21:T61a,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does the tool show fees, boards or ratings?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. It lists schools from map data. Confirm board affiliation, fees and admission rules with the school or the education department."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I check if a school is recognised?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Ask for the recognition and affiliation details and verify them on the respective board or state education department website."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why are some places missing from the results?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The data comes from map sources that may not list every business, and small or new places can be missing. Try a larger radius or a nearby landmark as the search area."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why do nearby results need location permission?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Near me uses your browser GPS. City search uses geocoding instead — no GPS needed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the Nearby Schools free on ContentVerse India?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. All India utility tools on ContentVerse India are free to use with no sign-up required."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is this an official government website?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. ContentVerse India is an independent platform. We use public datasets and open APIs. For official records, use government portals like Parivahan, GST, FoSCoS, or ECI."}}]}22:T83a,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"HowTo","name":"How to use Nearby Schools","description":"Moving to a new city or choosing a school for your child starts with knowing what is nearby. This nearby schools tool lists schools around any locality or your current location in India, with their addresses and map links, so you can shortlist options within a comfortable commute. Use it as a starti","url":"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/nearby-schools","totalTime":"PT5M","tool":{"@type":"HowToTool","name":"Nearby Schools"},"step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","position":1,"name":"How to find schools near you","text":"Type the locality or use your location, select a radius and search. The results show nearby schools with their address. Open the map link to see how far each school is from your home, and then check details on the school’s website or by visiting."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"How to shortlist and compare schools","text":"Start with distance and commute time, because a long daily journey tires young children. Then compare board affiliation (CBSE, ICSE, state board or IB), medium of instruction, class sizes, fee structure, transport availability and facilities such as labs, sports grounds and libraries."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":3,"name":"Admissions, age limits and the RTE Act","text":"Many schools fix a minimum age for entry, such as 3 years for nursery or 5 to 6 years for Class 1 as on a cut-off date. Use our age calculator to check your child’s age on the date the school specifies. Under the Right to Education Act, private unaided schools are required to reserve a share of seats for children from economically weaker sections; the process is run by the state, so check your state’s RTE portal for dates."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":4,"name":"Location, privacy and accuracy","text":"The tool asks for your location only when you press the “use my location” option, and your browser shows its own permission prompt. If you prefer not to share GPS, type an area or city instead; the search then uses geocoding and needs no permission."}]}17:[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebApplication\",\"name\":\"Nearby Schools\",\"alternateName\":\"Nearby Schools Finder India\",\"description\":\"Find schools near any location or city across India.\",\"url\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/nearby-schools\",\"applicationCategory\":\"UtilitiesApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Any\",\"browserRequirements\":\"Requires JavaScript\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"INR\"},\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"ContentVerse India\",\"url\":\"https://contentverse.co.in\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-IN\",\"featureList\":\"How to find schools near you, How to shortlist and compare schools, Admissions, age limits and the RTE Act, Location, privacy and accuracy\"}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$21"}}],["$","script","2",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"India Tools\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Nearby Schools\",\"item\":\"https://contentverse.co.in/tools/nearby-schools\"}]}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$22"}}]],"$L23"]
